 orreale\n- Randy Moore\n- Gabriela Gunčíková\n\n\n(synopsis non encore 
 traduit sur TMDB)\nCaptured live over the course of GHOST’s two sold-out
  shows in Mexico City last year\, 2 BIG TO RIG is the definitive document 
